<title>UK: CRICKET-BENSON AND HEDGES CUP QUARTER-FINAL DRAW.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BENSON AND HEDGES CUP QUARTER-FINAL DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the quarter-finals of the</p>
<p>Benson and Hedges Cup made on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Leicestershire v Somerset</p>
<p>Yorkshire v Northamptonshire</p>
<p>Kent v Warwickshire</p>
<p>Essex v Surrey</p>
<p>Matches to be played on Tuesday, May 27.</p>
